          "text": "Health concerns"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Worried about heart failure, sleep apnoea, brain tumour, and possible early dementia; wonders whether plant-based protein shakes and kombucha are affecting sleep hormones."
